Entries are percentage differences in expected personal votes for a one-SD increase in $A$, with municipality-clustered \Sexpr{paper_values$confidence_pct}\% intervals in brackets. All specifications use the same \Sexpr{n_main} candidates and retain all other baseline controls. The flexible adjustment uses gender-specific natural cubic splines for attractiveness.
